{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生写真撮影したよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったーかわいい衣装いっぱーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ガールズルールMV公開されました！\n夜にびしょ濡れになって撮影しました。\n相当過酷でした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんがニュースで\nMVがちょっと流れたのを見たとき\n自然と涙出てきたと言ってました。！\nそれくらいスタッフさんも\nメンバーもみんなで頑張った作品です。\nノスタルジックで綺麗な映像。\n涼しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は三つ編みガールです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このままプールに飛び込んだ！\nたぶん。たぶんだけど、\n曲終わりのプール大乱闘シーンで\n写ってる。あれ、たぶんだけど、\nたぶん私←\nあと、アイスに群がる3人の右が私！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも探してみてくれい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何うどんが好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おろしポン酢とかすだちとか\nサラダとかさっぱり系！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアーは\nメンバーみんな出るよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとそうだよ！\nライブ楽しみすぎるーーーー\n踊りたいよーーーーー\n........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三つ編み姉妹"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日なにしようかなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/07/1627630/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}